<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">Daniel</book>
  <para style="h">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniel</para>
  <para style="mt">Daniel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Jehoiakim kumpi a suo zaw a kum thumna kumin Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar pei-in Jerusalem a imtawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Judah Kumpipa Jehoiakim a kipan Pasien’ inn sunga om vante pawlkhat zong ama’ thuneina sungah omsah a, ama in Shinar gamah tuate puo-in a pasien-te’ goukholna inn sungah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in a kumpi innsung mangpa Ashpenaz kungah kumpi innkuon sung pan le milien namte lah panin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a khangdawng a pumpi tunga poina a nei lo, a melhoi, pilna siemna namcin a kiva, theina le mi navah, le kumpi inn sunga na a sem thei ding Israel mi pawlkhat hing sawl in, ci-in thu a pie hi; amate pen Chaldea lai le ham sin ding ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nisielin kumpipa tanh bangbang an le lenggazu tawh vah dingin kumpipa in amate thu a pie hi. Amate pen kum thum sung pilna kisinsah ding a, tua zaw ciengin kumpi thukhen zumpi ah nasem thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuate lahah Judah minam panin Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael, Azariah-te kihal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpi innsung mangpa in amate mindang phuopieh hi: Daniel’ min dingin Belteshazzar, Hananiah’ min dingin Shadrach, Mishael’ min dingin Meshach, Azariah’ min dingin Abednego ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin Daniel in kumpipa an le zu tawh ama le ama a kibuasah lo nadingin a khensat hi; tuaci’n ama in ama le ama a kibuasah lo nadingin kumpi innsung mangpa kungah phalna ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien in Daniel pen kumpi innsung mangpa tung panin angvanna le lainatna a ngasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpi innsung mangpa in Daniel kungah, “Ka pu kumpipa ka giing hi; na an neh ding le na dawn dingte ama in sesa-in nei zo hi. Ama in na khanguol khangdawng dangte sangin na tahsa uh a gawngzaw-in hing mukha leh note ziehin kumpipa in kei ei ngawngtan ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpi innsung mangpa in Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael le Azariah-te cing dinga a koi mipa kungah Daniel in tam bangin a thum hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hepina tawh na nasemte ni sawm sung ei en phot in. Ka neh ding uh ante lohing le ka dawn ding uh tuisih beh ei piesah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa’ an a ne khangdawngte melpuoh dan le ka melpuoh dan uh nei tekah thei ding a, tuaci’n nangma’ ei muna bang bangin na nasemte ei bawl ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in tam ngetna thukimin ni sawm sung amate a encih phot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni sawm a cin zaw ciengin kumpipa’ an a ne khangdawng zosie sangin a maisuo uh hoizaw a, zong thauzaw uhi, ci kimukhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n a cingpa in a kumpi an ule a dawn ding uh zute hemdawhin amate ante lohing beh a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasien in tam khangdawng lite tungah lailam le pilna vannuoi ah theina le siemna a pie hi; Daniel in mangmuna zosie le mangkhiet siemna zong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa in amate a kipeipi nadinga a sesa hun a cin ciengin kumpi innsung mangpa in Nebuchadnezzar mai-ah amate peipi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuale kumpipa in amate a hopi hi. Tuale amate zosie lahah Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael le Azariah-te tawh tekah thei ding koima kimu lo hi; tua ahi ziehin kumpi inn sunga na sem dingin amate kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pilna le theitelna tawh kisai-in a thudawh vannuoi ah a gambup sunga om mitphiel siemte le aisan thei zosie sangin a za sawmin a siem zawh lam uh kumpipa in mukhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Daniel in Kumpipa Cyrus kumpi a suo zaw a kum khatna dongin khum sungah a nasep a zomsuoh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar kumpi-a a maan zaw a kum nina kumin Nebuchadnezzar in mang pawlkhat man a, tuate ziehin lunggimin kimu thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in a mangmatte a gen dingin mitphiel siemte, aisan theite, mibum theite le Chaldea-te hlansah hi. Amate zong tungin kumpipa mai ah a din ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kumpipa in amate kungah, “Tam bang mang khat ka man a, tua ka mang a khietna ka thei nuom ziehin ka lung a gim hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chaldea-te in kumpipa kungah (Aram ham tawh), “Kumpipa aw, dam sawt in! Na nasemte na mang ei gen in, a khietna kang gen ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa in Chaldea-te dawng a, “Tam pen mipi zaha ka thukhensat ahi hi: Mang le a khietna nei gen thei sih uleh na khut na keng uh kisemnen ding a, na innte uh kisusie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hizongle ka mangmat le a khietna nei gen thei uleh keima tung panin letsongte, thamante le patawina lienpi na nga ding uhi. Tua ahi ziehin ka mangmat le a khietna ei gen un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in a ni veina dawngkia-in, “Kumpipa in na nasemte kungah na mang ei gen masa phot in, tua ciengin a khietna kang gen thei pan ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Kiptahin ka khensatsa teng na thei ziehun hun a sawt theithei nadinga hanciem na hi lamtah uh cientahin ka thei hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mangmat nei hilcien thei sih uleh note adingin thukhenna khat beh om hi. No teng pen ka lungsim ka khel masangsie keima kungah zuouthu le kam nainiehte gengen dinga kithukimsa na hi uhi. Tua ahi ziehin ka mangmat ei gen phot un, tua hile a khietna nang gen thei ding lam uh ka thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chaldea-te in kumpipa kungah, “Kumpipa thei nop thu a gen thei ding leitungah koima om sih va! A tahtahin bang za-in thupi-in vanglien tamale koima’ kumpi in mitphiel siemte, aisan theite, le Chaldea-te khat popo kungah tam bang thu dong ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa thudawh pen hamsa luo a, mihingte tawh a tengton lo pasien-te longal koima in kumpipa kungah tuate pholah thei lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami thu ziehin kumpipa lungthah mama a, Babylon gam sunga mipil zosie thalup dingin thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mipilte thalup nading thupiehna lai kihawm a, tuale mipilte thalup ding ahi ta hi; tuale amate in Daniel le a guol teng zong thalup dingin a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Daniel in Babylon gama mipilte that dinga a kuon kumpipa’ mithat makaipa Arioch kungah pilvangtah le kidawm tahin a dawngkia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ama in kumpi innsung ulien Arioch kungah, “Bang dinga kumpipa’ thupieh hici kinaw sengseng ahei?” ci-in a dong hi. Tua ciengin Arioch in a thu teng Daniel a theisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n Daniel lut a, tua mang a khietna gen ding hun a pieh nadingin kumpipa kungah ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Daniel a inn ah pei a, tuale ama in a guolte Hananiah, Mishael, le Azariah-te theisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in tam thuthuh tawh kisai-in Daniel le a guolte Babylon gam sunga mipil dangte tawh a siton lo nadingin vantung Pasien tung panin hepina ngen dingin amate kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin zanlai a mang sungah tua thuthuh Daniel tungah kilah a, tuale Daniel in vantung Pasien’ min a phat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Daniel in: “Kumtawnin Pasien’ min phatin om taheh, azieh pen pilna le vanglietna ama-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in hun le khuohunte khel a, kumpite khiesuhin kumpite koi hi; ama in mipilte tungah pilna pie a, theitelna a neite tungah pilna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in thuthuhpi le phuolsel nate phuong dawh a, khuomiel sunga omte thei-in ama tawh khuovah a omton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate’ Pasien aw, nang tungah ka lungdam a, nang kang phat hi. Pilna le vanglietna nei pieh ziehin nang kunga kang nget uh pen kei tungah nei pholah zo hi. Azieh pen kumpipa thupieh kote tungah nei theisah zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Babylon gamah mipilte that dinga kumpipa in a sesa Arioch kungah Daniel pei a, ama in tuapa kungah, “Babylon mipilte that sin; kumpipa mai-ah ei peipi in, kumpipa mang ka khiehpieh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Arioch in kumpipa mai-ah Daniel mallang tahin peipi-in ama kungah tam bangin a gen hi: “Judah salte lah panin kumpipa mang ang khiehpieh thei ding mi khat ka mu hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kumpipa in Belteshazzar a kici Daniel kungah, “Ka mangmat le a khietna keima kungah nei gen thei diei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Daniel in kumpipa kungah, “Mipil, aisan siem, mitphiel siem ahi sihle bumtawi siemte koima in kumpipa nget thuthuhpi ama tungah pholah thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanle a kisel thusimte a pholah thei vantungah Pasien khat om a, ama in Nebuchadnezzar Kumpipa kungah mailam huna a pieng ding thute a pholah zo hi. Na mang le lupna tunga na lup laitaha na lungsim sungah na mangmute tam teng ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa aw, lupna tunga na lup laitahin mailam ang pieng ding thute na ngaisun a, tuale a kisel thusimte a pholah pa in nang tungah ang pieng ding thute ang pholah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin kei ka hile hinna a nei midangte sanga ka pil zawh zieha tam thusimte kei tunga ei kipholah hi loin, kumpipa in mang a khietna na thei nading le na lungsim sunga na ngaisutnate na thei nadinga ei kipholah hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Kumpipa aw, nangma in na en leh, ka nu vawi! na mai ah milim golpi khat a om hi. Tam milim gol mama a, a tan dan tuomdang mama hi; na mai ah tua milim ding a, a melpuoh dan zong giinhuoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua milim lutang kham citah hi a, a awm le a bante ngun hi-in, a gil le a pheite sumngo ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />a kengte sia hi-in, a kephangte a phal sia, a phal tungman ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na etto laitahin mihing khuta a kisuizol ahi lo suongtum khat in sia le tungman kisawhal tua milim kephang dengmatin a guoicim ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin sia, tungman, sumngo, ngun, le khamte a unpi-in guoicim sieng a, khuokhal lai ancilna-a ansi leng tawh kibang hi; tuale a themneng zong a kimu nawn lo nadingin hui in tua teng tawmang sieng hi. Ahi vangin tua milim a dengguoi suongtum pen muol golpi khat suohin leitung bup a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Na mang tami ahi hi; tu-in a khietna kumpipa kungah kang gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kumpipa aw, nang pen kumpite’ kumpipa na hi a, vantung Pasien in nangma tungah kumpi gam, vanglietna, thahatna, le minthanna ang pie zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />ama in na khut sungah mun cintenga a teng mihingte, gamlaha a om gamsate, vana a leng vate ang pie zo hi; tuale amate tungah a uh dingin nangma ang koi zo ta hi, tua kham lutang khu nangma na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nangma zaw ciengin nangma sanga a gina lo zaw kumpi gam adang khat ang khang ding a, hinanle a thumna sumngo kumpi gam in leitung buppi uh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuale sia banga a thahat a lina kumpi gam khat ang khang ding hi; sia in na vannuoi satguoi-in a vatmai bangin tam teng zosie gawi-in a zancimsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A kephang le a kemete a phal belkhengpa’ tungman le a phal sia kihal na mu bangin tua kumpi gam kikhenzah ding hi; hizongle tungman le sia a kihal na mu bangin a sungah sia bangin hatna kimkhat om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A kephanga a kemete a phal sia, a phal tungman ahi ma bangin kumpi gam a phal thahatin a phal zawngkhal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Sia le tungman kihal na mu bangin amate khatlekhat kiteng kipi-in a kisawhal ding vua, hinanle sia le tungman a kicimat thei lo bangin amate zong a kigawm thei tuom sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua kumpite khan sungin vantung Pasien in a kisusie ngai nawn lo ding kumpi gam khat phut ding a, tam kumpi gam pen midang khat’ khut sungah kinuasie lo ding hi. Tua in tami kumpi gam teng zosie satguoi-in maimangsah ding a, tua gam a kip tawntung ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />muol tung panin mihing khuta kisui lo suongtum khat ang lengkhie-in sia, sumngo, tungman, ngun, le khamte a satguoina na mu bang lienin a lien Pasien in mailam thu pieng dingte kumpipa kunga ang theisah ahi hi. Na mang pen mangpi ahi a, a khietna zong muontah ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar a mai leilahah kunsuhin Daniel bie a, ama adingin an tawh biehna le gimnamtui biehnate lui dingin thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Kumpipa in Daniel kungah, “A tahtahin na Pasien pen pasien-te’ Pasien le kumpite’ Topa ahi a, thusimte a pholah pa zong ahi hi, azieh pen nang in tami thusim na pholah thei ta hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Daniel tawisangin letsong thupi tampitah pie a, Babylon gam buppi uhsahin, Babylon mipil zosie tungah uhpi pa dingin koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Daniel in kumpipa kungah ngen a, Babylon gamkhen tenga vaihawm dingin Shadrach, meshach, le Abednego-te koi hi. Ahi vangin kumpipa inn sungah Daniel a om suoh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar in a tun tong sawmguh a sang, avai tong guh a gol kham milim khat a bawl hi; ama in tua pen Babylon gamsung Dura zanglei ah phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin gamkaih uhpite, gamkaih uhpi hute, mangpite, thu kuppite, sumkem mangte, thukhente, thukhen mangte, le a gamkaihte sunga uliente zosie kikhawmin Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar’ phusa milim apna pawi sim dingin Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar in amate hlansah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpi Nebuchadnezzar in a phusa milim apna pawi sim dingin gam uhte, gam uhpi hute, mangpite, thu kuppite, sumkem mangte, thukhente, thukhen mangte, le a gamkhente sunga uliente zosie a kikhawm uhi. Nebuchadnezzar in a phusa milim mai-ah amate a din laitahun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tangko pa in nahpi-in tangtawh a, “Mipite, minamte, le ham nam tuomtuomte aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />note in sielki gin, theile gin, lyre gin, trigon gin, harp gin, tawm gin, le tumging namcin’ gin na zah ciengun Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar’ phusa kham milim mai-ah bawhsuhin na bieh nadingun thu ang kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawhsuhin a bie lo poma thakhatin meilipi sungah kisep ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin mipi zosie in sielkii gin, theile gin, lyre gin, trigon gin, harp gin, tawm gin, le tumging namcin’ gin a zah behun mipite, minamte, le ham nam zosie bawhsuhin Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar’ phusa tua kham milim a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua bang ahi ziehin Chaldea mi pawlkhat khum hunin pei-in Jew mite a mawpai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar kungah, “Kumpipa aw, dam sawt in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa aw, nangma in sielkii gin, theile gin, lyre gin, trigon gin, harp gin, tawm gin, le tumging namcin’ gin a za poma bawhsuhin kham milim bie ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />bawhsuhin a bie lo poma meilipi sungah kisep ding hi, ci-in thupieh khat na bawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua sungah Babylon gamkhen uh dinga na koi: Shadrach, Meshach, le Abednego a kici Jew mi pawlkhat a om uhi. Kumpipa aw, tam teng in nangma ang thusim sih uhi. Amate in na pasien-te’ na sem loin na phusa kham milim zong a bie nuom sih uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Nebuchadnezzar thangpai mama ahi ziehin ama kungah Shadrach, Meshach, le Abednego-te a kipeipi nadingin thu a pie hi; tuaci’n amate in kumpipa mai-ah tua mi teng a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Shadrach, Meshach, le Abednego-te aw, note in ka pasien-te’ na sem loin keima’ phusa kham milim na bieh lo uh a man ma amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in a baisa-a na op uleh sielkii gin, theile gin, lyre gin, trigon gin, harp gin, tawm gin, le tumging namcin’ gin na zah ciengun bawhsuhin ka bawlsa milim na bieh uleh a hoi a pha ahi hi. Ahi vangin na bieh nop sih uleh meilipi sungah hing kisep ding hi, tua hile ka khut sung panin note ang hunkhie zo ding koi pasien om ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Shadrach, Meshach, le Abednego-te in kumpipa kungah, “Nebuchadnezzar aw, tam thu tawh kisai-in nangma kungah ka kihut ding uh kisam ka sa sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa aw, a na ka sep uh kote’ Pasien in meilipi pan le na khut sung panin ei hutkhiet zo leh kote ei hunkhie taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin kumpipa aw, ei hutkhiet zo sih leh zong na pasien-te’ na ka sem tuom sih ding vua, na phusa kham milim zong ka bie tuom sih ding uhi, ci thu kithei ta’n,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Shadrach, Meshach, le Abednego-te tungah Nebuchadnezzar thangpai-in a mit a mai a kikhuleh hi. Ama in meilipi a sat ngaina za sangin a za sagivei a sazaw-in tawkuong dingin thu pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuale Shadrach, Meshach, le Abednego-te a kanbawm ding le meilipi sungah a sepsuh dingin a galkapte lahah a thahatpen pawlkhat thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n a puontuol uh , a bawngbi uh, a lukhu ule adang a puonsilte uh a sil laipi ma-un tua mite a kanbawm vua, meilipi sungah a sepsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kumpipa thupieh kinaw-in meilipi lah a sat seng ziehin meilipi sungah Shadrach, Meshach, le Abednego-te a sepsuh mite meikuong in a hulvam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin Shadrach, Meshach, le Abednego pasal thumte a kikanbawmsa-in meili lai-ah a kiesuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in lamdangsa-in a nawdin hi. Ama in a thu kuppite kungah, “Khumte khu a kikanbawmsa-a meilipi lai-ah a kisepsuh mihing thumte hi lo uh amah?” a ci hi. Amate in, “Hima hi, kumpipa aw,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in, “Ahi vangin keima in a kikanbawm loin mihing li meili lai-ah a vah kawikawi ka mu a, zong a liem beh sih uhi; tua a lina pa in pasien khat’ melpuoh dan a nei hi,” ci-in a dawngkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin meilipi kotkhah lam nehin Nebuchadnezzar pei a, ama in, “Sangpen Pa Pasien’ nasem Shadrach, Meshach, le Abednego-te aw, hing pusuoh un! Tanah hing pei un!” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Shadrach, Meshach, le Abednego-te meili panin a pusuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuale gam uhte, gam uhpi hute, mangpite, le kumpipa’ thu kuppite a kikhawm vua, tua mihing lite citungah mei in bangma a law thei lo lam a mukhie uhi; amau’ luzanga a samte mei in a hulgawp lo banah a puonsilte uzong bangma ci loin meikhu gim zong nam beh lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar in, “Shadrach, Meshach, le Abednego-te’ Pasien, a vantungmi sawlin ama a muong a nasemte a hunkhie pa in thupha nga taheh. Amate in a Pasien uh longal pasien dangte khatpo’ na semin a bieh ding uh sangin kumpipa thupiehna mang loin a pumpi uh a si ngamzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin keima in tam bang thupieh khat ka bawl hi: Koi mi, koi nam, koi hamin ham zongle Sharach, Meshach, le Abednego-te’ Pasien a gensie tapo a khut a keng ki-ehmal ding a, a innte uh kisusie ding hi; azieh pen tam banga mi hunkhie thei pasien dang om lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Babylon gamkhen sungah Shadrach, Meshach, le Abednego-te a za uh a khangsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar in leitung muncin tenga a teng mi zosie, nam zosie, le ham zosie tungah gen hi: Note in a kiningcing nopsahna thupha nei ta un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sangpen Pa Pasien in kei dinga a bawlsa lim le nalamdangte kang gensawn nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’ limte bangza-in lienin, a na lamdang bawlte bangza-in thahat ahei! A kumpi gam pen kumtawn kumpi gam hi a, a khang khangin ama’ thuneina a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima Nebuchadnezzar lungnuomin ka inn ah ka teng a, ka kumpi inn sungah nuomsa-in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka mangmat khat in ei zausisah a, ka lupna tunga ka lungsan teng le ka mangmuna teng in ei dipkuosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in ka mangmat a khietna gen dingin Babylon gam sunga mipil zosie ka mai-ah ang puoh nadingun thu ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin mitphiel siemte, aisan theite, Chaldea-te, le mibum theite ang lut vua, amate kungah ka mangmat ka gen hi. Ahi vangin amate in a khietna ei gen thei lo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tawpna ah ka mai-ah Daniel ang pei a, ama pen ka pasien’ min kitapin Belshazzar a kici pa ahi a, a siengtho pasien-te’ hlagau khat tawh a kidim hi. Tuale ama kungah ka mangmat ka sut hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mitphiel dawi siempen Belteshazzar aw, a siengtho pasien-te’ hlagau khat tawh na kidim a, nang adingin a hamsa seng thuthuh om lo ci ka thei hi. Ka mangmat za inlen a khietna ei gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lupna tunga ka mang mu tami ahi hi; leitung laikimah singkung khat po a, tua singkung sang mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua singkung khangin gol semsem a, a dawn in van holto hi. Leimong teng panin tua singkung kimu thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nate hoi a, a ga zong tamin, mi vannuoi an a sih hi. Gamlahah gamsate in a hlim a bel vua, vana a leng vate in a ba tung lahah bu bawlin hinna nei zosie tua tawh a kivah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A banah ka enkia leh lupna tunga ka lup laitahin ka mangmuna sungah vantung panin a cing misiengtho khat ang kumsuh ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Awng vapuohin ama in tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Tua singkung phua-in a ba teng tansan unlen, a na teng heu siengin a ga teng zong thezah un. A hlim bel ganhingte le a ba tunga a tuong vate heudawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin a bul le a zungte lei sungah omsah unlen, gamlah lopate lahah sumngo le siakhau-in hen un. Van daituite in tapnom hinlen, ama’ tanh ding pen gamsate-a’ tawh kibang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A lungsim, mihing lungsim panin kikhel hinlen ganhing lungsim puo taheh. A za sagi-in ama tungah tung taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sangpen Pa in mihingte’ kumpi gamah thu nei pen hi, ci thu hinna nei zosie in a thei nadingin, thukhenna pen a cingte khensatna bangin kisem a, thukhenna pen mi siengthote’ thupiehna tawh kisem ahi hi; ama in a pieh nuomte tungah kumpi gam pie a, mi tuolniem pente tungah kumpi gam a pie hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar’ mang mat tami ahi hi. Belteshazzar aw, ka kumpi gam sunga om mipil zosie in a khietna ei gen thei lo ziehun nangma in tu-in a khietna ei gen in. Hizongle nang a siengtho pasien-te’ hlagau tawh na kidim ziehin a khietna nei gen thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Belteshazzar min nei Daniel bakhat sung nahpitahin a lung a kham hi. A ngaisutnate in ama a patausah hi. Kumpipa in, “Belteshazzar aw, na mangmat le a khietna ziehin kizausah laizang sin,” a ci hi. Belteshazzar in, “Ka pu aw, na mangmat pen nangma ang mudate-a’ hizaw hinlen, a khietna zong na galte-a’ hizaw taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na singkung mu pen ang khang a, ang golin van ang holto a, leimong dongin kimu thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A nate hoi-in a ga zong tamin mi zosie an a sih hi. Tuale gamsate in a hlim a bel vua, a bate tungah vana vate in bu a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kumpipa aw, tua khu nangma na hi hi! Nang na khanglien a, na thahat hi. Na vanglietna khang semsemin van na holto a, na thuneina in leimong dong a huop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuale kumpipa in na et laitahin vantung panin a cing mi siengtho khat na mu a, ‘Tua singkung phuadawh unlen susie un, ahi vangin a bul le a zungte lei sungah omsah unlen, gamlah lohingte lahah siakhau le sumngo-in henin vantung daitui in ama a tehlopsah a, tuaci’n ama tungah a za sagivei a tun dongin gamsate tawh tengtonsah un,’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a ci pen kumpipa aw, a khietna tam bang ahi a, Sangpen Pa in ka pu kumpipa tunga ang tunsah a thukhenna ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihingte lah panin ang kinotmang ding a, gamsate tawh na tengton ding hi. Bawngtang bangin lopa ang kinesah ding a, vantung daitui in hing tehlopsahin Sangpen Pa in mihingte’ kumpi gam sungah thunei penin pang a, kumpi gam a pieh nuomte tungah a pie hi, ci na thei masangsie na tungah sagivei a tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Singbul le a zungte lei sunga nuasie ding thu a kipieh bangin Vantung in thunei hi, ci na thei huna kipanin nang adingin na kumpi gam ang kiphupieh kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin kumpipa aw, nang tunga kang thuhilna ei sanpieh in: Na mawnate adingin dihna tawh mawsut inlen, na nopsahna sawtvei na khom nadingin a kibawlsie mite tungah hepina tawh na khielnate sut in. Tua hile na nopsahna sawtvei na khom ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar tungah tam zosie a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hla sawm le hla ni zaw ciengin Babylon kumpi innkhum zangah ama vah kawikawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tuale kumpipa in, “Tami a thupi Babylon, kumpi khuopi ding le keima’ minthan thupi nadinga a thahat ka vanglietna tawh ka lamsa hi lo amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kumpipa’ kam sungah tua kammalte a pusuo laitahin vantung panin aw khat ang ging hi: “Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar aw, nang dinga tami thu ang kigen ahi hi: Nang tung panin kumpi gam a peikhie zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihingte lah panin ang kinotmang ding a, gamlahah gamsate tawh na tengton ding hi. Bawngtang bangin lopa ang kinesah ding a, Sangpen Pa in mihingte’ kumpi gamah thunei penin pangin tua kumpi gam a pieh nuomte tungah a pie hi, ci na thei masangsie nang tungah sagivei ang tung ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar tungah thakhatin thukhenna a tangtung pai hi. Mihingte lah panin ama kinotmangin bawngtang bangin lopa ne a, a samte muvanlai’ multe bang le a cinte va kecin banga a sau dongin van daitui in a citung teng a tehlopsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khum hun ang tawp ciengin keima Nebuchadnezzar in van lam ka ento leh khuo ka phawhkia hi. Sangpen Pa ka phat a, a hing zing pa phatin ka patawi hi. Azieh pen a thuneina in kumtawn thuneina hi a, ama’ kumpi gam zong a khangkhangin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Leitunga teng mi zosie bangma-in kisim lo a, ama in vantung nate le leitunga teng mite tungah a dei bangin na sem hi. Koima in ama’ khut tu zo lo a, ama kungah koima in “Bang bawl na hei?” ci lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Khum hunin keima in khuo ka phawhkia hi; tuale ka kumpi gam minthan nadingin ka vanglietna le ka thupina keima tungah ei kipiekia hi. Ka thu kuppite le ka uliente in keima ei sui vua, ka kumpi gam sungah kumpi-in ei kikoi kia-in ka tungah vanglietna a golzaw ei kipiehbe lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tu-in keima Nebuchadnezzar in vantung Kumpipa phatin tawisangin zatahna ka pie hi. Azieh pen a nasep zosie thuman ahi a, a lampi zosie thutang ahi hi; ama in kilietsahna tawh a gamta mite a niemkhieh thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Belshazzar in a ulien tulkhat adingin pawi lienpi khat bawl a, mi tulkhat mai-ah zu a dawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Belshazzar in a zu lungnop kawmin kumpipa le a uliente, a zite le a meite zu dawn nadingin amate in Jerusalem biehinnpi pana a pa Nebuchadnezzar in a na lah kham hai le ngun haite a lah nadingun thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Jerusalem Pasien’ biehinnpi pana a kila kham hai le ngun haite peipi-in kumpipa le a uliente, a zite le a meite in tuate tawh zu a dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in zu dawnin ngun le kham, sumngo, sia, sing le suong pasien-te’ min a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thakhatin mihing’ khut khat kilang a, meivah tunna gei, za a kizut kumpi inn kawm tungah lai giel ang kipan pai hi. Tua khut in lai a giel laitahin kumpipa in a en khinkhian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa mai daang gawpin a ngaisutna in ama zausisah a, a khut a kengte zawmangin a khup tegel a tun dildel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa in aisan theite, Chaldea-te, le bumtawite va hlan ta un, ci-in kiko hi; tuale Kumpipa in Babylon mipilte kungah, “Tami lai kigiel sim thei-in a khietna ei gen thei tapo puon sandup kisilsah ding a, a ngawngah kham khi ki-awsahin kumpi gam sungah a zalien a thumna-in kikoi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa’ mipil zosie a lut vua, ahi vangin amate in tua lai kigiel sim thei loin, kumpipa kungah a khietna zong a gen thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua bepin Kumpi Belshazzar nahpi-in zausi-in a mai kangdang a, a uliente a lung uh a buoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpinu in kumpipa le a uliente thu kikup a zah ciengin pawi khaamna inn sungah a lut hi. Kumpinu in, “Kumpipa aw, na khan sawt taheh! Na ngaisutna ziehin kizausisah sinlen, na mai dangsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kumpi gam sungah a siengtho pasien-te’ hlagau a nei mi khat a om hi. Na pa hun lai-in tua mipa in pasien-te’ pilna tawh a kibang thuthuh theina, thu theitelna le pilna a nei hi. Na pa Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar in mitphiel siemte, aisan theite, Chaldea-te, le mibum theite’ uhpi-in ama na koi ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen kumpipa in a min Belshazzar a phuopieh Daniel sungah mang khieh theina, thu hahsate dawn theina, le thubuoite vensah theina ahi koima in a bat zawh lo pilna, theina, thu theitelnate kimu hi. Tu-in Daniel hlansah in, tua hile ama in a khietna ang gen thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa mai-ah Daniel kipeipi hi. Kumpipa in Daniel kungah, “Nang pen Daniel a kici pa, Judah gam sung pana ka pa kumpipa in ang mat Judah mite lahah sila khat hi lo na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang sungah pasien-te’ hlagau a op lam ka na za zo a, thuthuh theina, thu theitelna, le koima in a bat zawh lo pilna na sungah a op lam kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in tam lai kigiel a sim ding le a khietna ei gen dingin mipilte, aisan theite ka mai-ah ang kipeipi zo ta a, ahi vangin amate in tua thu a khietna a gen thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin nangma in a khietna na gen thei a, thubuoite zong na vengsah thei hi, ci-in ka na za zo hi. Tu-in tua lai kigiel na sim thei a, a khietna nei gen thei leh, puon sandup ang kisilsahin na ngawngah kham khi ang ki-awsah ding a, kumpi gam sungah a za lien a thumna-in ang kikoi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Daniel in kumpipa mai-ah dawng a, “Na letsongte nangma adingin koi in. Ahi sihle na nuommante midang khat pie in! Hizongle kumpipa adingin tua lai kigiel kang simpieh ding a, a khietna kang theisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa aw, Sangpen Pa Pasien in kumpi-in na pa Nebuchadnezzar koi a, zalietna, vang le thupina a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale ama tunga a pieh zalietna ziehin ama mai-ah mi zosie, minam zosie, le ham zosie citun uhi. Ama in a tha nuomte thatin a hinkhawi nuomte hinkhawi a, a patawi nuomte patawi-in, a daisah nuomte daisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin a lungsim kisangsahin kisathei tahin a gamtat nadingin a lung a khau ciengin a kumpi topha panin kiladawh a, ama kung panin a vang kihawhmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihingte lah panin kinotmang a, a lungsim zong ganhing lungsim nei dingin kibawl hi. Gam sakolte tawh tengtonin bawngtang bangin lopa kinesah a, Sangpen Pa Pasien in mihingte’ kumpi gamah thunei a, kumpi gam a pieh nuom pa tungah pie hi, ci thu a thei masangsie van daitui in a pumpi tehlopsah den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuale a tapa nang Belshazzar in tam thu zosie na thei sieng vangin na lungsim na niemkhieh tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang in Vantung’ Topa na do a, nang le nang na kitawisang hi! Ama’ biehinn sunga haite nangma kungah ang kitawi zo a, nang le na uliente, na zite le na meite un tuate tawh zu dawn zo ta uhi. Khuo a mu lo, khuo a za lo, a theithei lo, ngun le kham, sumngo, sia, sing le suong pasien-te’ min na phat uhi; ahi vangin a vanglietna sungah na hinna hu uh omin na gamtatna zosie uh ang saipieh Pasien na zatah sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tuaci’n a opna panin tua khut ang kisawlin tam lai ang kigielsah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A kigiel lai tam bang ahi hi: MENE, MENE, TEKEL, le PARSIN.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua thu a khietna tam bang ahi hi: MENE, Pasien in na kumpi gam vaihawmna hunte sim zo a, tawpsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />TEKEL, nang ang kitawikhai zo a, na leh zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />PERES, na kumpi gam kikhen khamin Media le Persia-te kipie zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin Daniel puon dupsan silsah dingin Belshazzar in thu pie a, a ngawngah kham khi awsahin a kumpi gam sungah a za lien a thumna dingin tangtawhna kinei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khum zan mama-in Chaldea-te’ kumpipa Belshazzar kithat pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kum sawmguh le kum ni a phah kumin Mede mi Darius in kumpi gam nga hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darius in kumpi gam buppi vai sai dingin gamkhen uhpi za le sawmni koi dingin pha a sa a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuale amate tungah vaisaipi mi thum koi-in, tuate lahah Daniel zong khatin kihal hi; kumpipa in sup le bai a tuo lo nadingin tua gamkhen uhpite in tam teng tungah thu a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Daniel in koima’ bat zawh lo pilna a nei ziehin adang vaisaipite le gamkhen uhpite lahah kituom khai a, kumpipa in gam buppi vaihawm dingin koi sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n vaisaipite le gamkhen uhte in kumpi gam tawh kisai-in Daniel tungah mawmat nading hamlap a tangsui uhi. Ahi vangin ama thumanin a thoptat sih a, ama tungah sietna a kimu zo lo ziehin amate in mawmat nading hamlap ahi a, sietna ahi zongin a muzo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua mite in, “A Pasien’ thukham tawh kisai-in i mu lo buong uleh tami Daniel tungah i mawmat nading uh hamlap dang i mu zo sih ding uhi,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n vaisaipite le gamkhen uhpite kidap kupin kumpipa kungah a pei vua, “Kumpipa Darius aw, na khan sau taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa aw, ni sawmthum sung nangma kung simlo mi khatpo kung ahi sihle pasien khatpo kunga thungen poma humpi kuo sungah kikhie ding hi, ci-in thupiehna lai le khamna lai khat bawl lacin hoi ding hi, ci-in kumpi gam sunga vaisaipite, gamkaih uhpi hute, gamkaih uhpite, thu kuppite, le mangpite zosie ka kithukim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa aw, tu-in Medes-te le Persia-te upadi a kikhel lo bangin a kikhel lo nadingin tua lai tungah na suoi kai in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Kumpi Darius in thupiehna lai le khamna lai tungah suoi a kai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Daniel in tua thupiehna lai suoi kikai zo ci a thei vangin Jerusalem lam nga-in tawlet honsa-a om a inndan tungnungah pei-in nidanga a bawl ngai bangin ni khatin thumvei khupdinin a Pasien tungah thu ngenin ama a phat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A sawmdapte a pei ule Pasien mai-ah Daniel in hepina a nget laitah a tuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in kumpipa kung a neh vua, tuale thupiehna lai tawh kisai-in, “Kumpipa aw! Ni sawmthum sungin nang kung longal pasien ahi sihle mihing tunga thu ngen poma humpi kuo sungah kikhie ding hi, ci-in thupiehna lai tungah suoi kai zo hi lo na mah?” a ci uhi. Kumpipa in, “ Medes-te le Persia-te upadi a kiphel thei lo ma bangin tam thu pen thukip ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in kumpipa a dawngkia vua, “Kumpipa aw, Judah gam panin na salte lahah khat ahi Daniel in nang le na suoikaina khamna lai a thuse sih a, tuale mahin ni khatin thumvei thu a ngen zawsop hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa in tua mawsahna thu a zah ciengin lung gim mama hi. Ama in Daniel hunkhie nuom a, ni tum dongin ama a hutkhiet nading hanciem thei tawpin a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa kungah a sawmdapte pei-in ama kungah, “Kumpipa aw, thei in. Medes le Persia-te’ upadi banga kumpipa in a bawlsa khamna lai ahi sihle thupiehna lai pen kikhel thei lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in thu pie-in Daniel a zawpi vua, humpi kuo sungah a khiesuh uhi. Kumpipa in Daniel kungah, “Thuman taha a na naseppieh na Pasien in hing hunkhie taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Suongtum khat kila-in humpi kuo vangah kikoi a, tuale Daniel tawh kisai-in thu a kikhel khah nawn lo nadingin kumpipa in ama’ seal tupna khutsip le a uliente’ seal tupna khutsip tawh a ciemte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin a kumpi inn sungah kumpipa pei-in ama in zan tawntungin an a ngawl hi; ama kungah bangma an kipuoh lo a, zong kimu thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuo a vah lien tahin kumpipa tho-in humpi kuo lamah mallangin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Daniel opna humpi kuo gei a tun ciengin Daniel kungah patau tahin kiko a, “Daniel aw, a hing zing Pasien’ nasempa, thuman taha a na nasep pieh na Pasien in humpi panin ang hunkhie zo ei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Daniel in kumpipa kungah, “Kumpipa aw, na khan sau taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama mai-ah kei nuol baang loin ei kimu ziehin keima ei liemsah lo nadingun ka Pasien in a vantung mite sawlin humpite’ kam a humpieh hi; tuale kumpipa aw, keima in na mai-ah zong bangma khielna ka bawl sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua bepin nahpitahin kumpipa lungdam a, humpi kuo sung panin Daniel a lahdawh nadingun thu a pie hi. Tuaci’n humpi kuo sung panin Daniel kiladawh a, ama in a Pasien a muon ziehin a ci tungah liemma khat beh kimu lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Daniel a leheh teng- amate, a tate ule a zite utawh- kizawpi-in humpi kuo sunga khieh dingin kumpipa in thu a pie hi. Humpi kuo tawdop a tun masangun humpite in amate na zothaw-in a gu a tangin a tepguoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Darius in leitung muncin tenga a om mi zosie, nam zosie le ham zosiete tungah tam bangin lai a hlah hi: “Note in a kicing nopsahna thupha nga ta un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keima in thupieh khat ka bawl a, ka uhna kumpi gam sunga om mi zosie in Daniel’ Pasien mai-ah zatahin citun ding uhi: Azieh pen ama a hing zing Pasien hi a, kumtawnin ama a om zing hi. A kumpi gam kisusie ngai lo ding a, a vaihawmna tawp ngai lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in suotasahin hunkhie a, ama in vantung le leitungah lim le nalamdangte a bawl hi; azieh pen humpi thahatna panin Daniel a hunkhie zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n tami Daniel pen Darius uh sung le Persia mi Cyrus uh sungin a daupei mama hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Belshazzar, Babylon kumpi a suo zaw a kum masa kumin Daniel in mang khat man a, a lupna tungah a lup laitahin a lungsim sungah mangmunate nei hi. Tua ciengin ama in lai tawh a mangmat tam bangin giel hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima Daniel in zan lai-in ka mangmuna sungah tuipi lien a lawhling van ning lite ka mu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuipi panin gamsa gol li ang pusuohto a, tuate khatlekhat kibang lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amasa pen humpi tawh kibangin muvanlai hla nei hi. Tua ciengin keima in ka et laitahin a hlate kibotin lei lah panin kidomsang a, mihing bangin a keng tegel tawh kidingsahin ama tungah mihing lungsim kiguon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nina gamsa adang khat ang kilang a tua pen vompi tawh kibang hi. A pang lang khatin dingto-in a kam sunga a hate kikalah a hapate thum om a, “Tho inlen luong tampi ne in!” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami zaw ciengin keima in ka en leh gamsa adang khat ang kilangkia a, tua pen lutnu tawh kibang hi. Tua gamsa in a elzangah va hla li nei a, lutang li nei hi; tuale ama tungah uhna aana kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami zaw ciengin zanlai ka mangmuna ah a giinhuoi, a cimulthaw huoi, le a thahat mama a lina gamsa khat ka mu hi. Tua in siaha gol khat nei a, ama in nawmvalin ehmal a, a omlai teng a keng tawh tuoncil hi. Ama pen a masanga gamsate tawh kibang loin ki sawm nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in tua a kite ka ngaisut laitahin tuate lah panin adang a ki neu khat ang po a, tuami op nadingin a masanga a ki thumte a zung panin kibotkhie hi. Tami a ki tungah mihing mittang tawh a kibang mittangte om a, kiliensah tahin a ham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka et laitahin kumpi tophate kipha a, a kumpi topha tungah Khanglui Mipa a to hi. A puonsil vua bangin ngo a, a luzanga a samte zong tuumul bangin a siengtho hi; a kumpi topha mei-am hi a, a topha lengkangte meikuong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meikuong lomkhat a pusuoh a, a mai panin tui luonin a luong hi. Mi tul za tampi in ama’ na a sem vua, ama a khoi dingin tul za sawm tampi a ding uhi. Thukhen dingin zumah kito a, laibute kiphen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuami ki in kiphatsahna kam a ham ziehin ka en khinkhian hi. Tuale keima in ka et laitahin tua gamsa kithatin a pumpi kisusie a, mei tawh hal dingin kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A omlai gamsate pen amau’ uhna aana kilahpieh a, ahi vangin a nuntahna uh a kiciengtan hun khat sung kikhanpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in zan ka mangmuna-ah ka en a, mihing tawh a kibang khat vana meii tung tuongin ang pei ka mu hi. Khanglui Mipa kungah ama pei a, ama mai-ah kizawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama tungah uhna aana, vang le kumpi za kipie a, mi zosie, nam zosie, le ham zosie in a na sem ding uhi. Ama’ uhna aana pen kumtawn uhna aana hi a, tua uhna tawp ngai loin a kumpi gam zong kisusie ngai lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima Daniel ka hile ka sung tawngah ka buoi mama a, ka mangmunate in ka lungsim ei patausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tami thu zosie tawh kisai-in thuman dong dingin a cingte lahah khat ka va nai ta hi. Tuaci’n ama in tua thu a khietna kang hil ding hi, ei ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tami gamsa lite pen kumpi gam li ahi a, leitung panin kumpi li ang khang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hizongle Sangpen Pa’ misiengte in kumpi gam a tang ding vua, tua kumpi gam kumtawnin a nei zing ding uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in a omlai teng zosie tawh a kilamdang, nahpi taha a giinhuoi, siaha le sumngo kecin a nei, ehmalin a nawmval, a omlai teng a keng tawh a tuoncil gamsa lina tungtang thu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />le a lutunga po a ki sawmte le, tuate lahah thum kiladawhin mittangte nei-in kiliensah tahin a kam pau, tua adangte sanga a goltuohzaw, tua adang ang poto ki tungtang thu ka thei nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima in ka et laitahin tami ki in misiengte tawh gal kido a, tua
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khanglui Mipa ang pei masangin amate a zo gawp hi; tua ciengin Sangpen Pa’ misiengte tungah thukhen theina kipie a, misiengte in kumpi gam a nga nading uh hun a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama gen khu tami ahi hi: “Gamsa lina pen, leitunga ang pieng ding kumpi gam lina hi a, kumpi gamdang zosie tawh kibang lo ding hi. Tua in leitung buppi valtum ding a, tuoncilin ehmal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ki sawmte tawh kisai pen, tam kumpi gam sung panin kumpi sawm ang khang ding a, amate nua-ah adang khat ang khangkhie ding hi. Tam pen a omsate tawh kibang loin kumpi thumte a nuoinet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in Sangpen Pa langpanna kam pau-in, Sangpen Pa’ misiengte genthei bawl ding a, a siengtho pawibawl hunte le thukhamte khel ding hanciemin, ama’ khut sungah hun khat, hun ni, le hun lang sung amate a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin thukhenin kito ding a, ama’ uhna aana kilah piehin kisumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpi za, uhna aana, le vansin nei buppi sunga Sangpen Pa’ misiengte tungah a kumpi gam thupina teng kipie ding hi. Amau’ kumpi gam pen kumtawn kumpi gam hi ding a, vaihawm zosie in amau’ na semin a thu mang ding uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam sungah tangthu a kihiel ahi ta hi. Keima Daniel ka hile ka lungsim ngaisutna in ei zausahin ka mai a engdang vawt hi; ahi vangin tami thu ka lungsim sungah ka koi khinkhian hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima kungah mangmuna khat ang kilah masah zaw, Belshazzar kumpi suo a kum thumna kumin keima Daniel kungah mangmuna khat ang kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in tua mangmuna sungah ka et laitahin Elam gamkhen Susa khuopi sunga a omin kei le kei ka kimu a, Ulai gun gei-ah ka ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka dahto leh gun gei-a a ding tuutang khat ka mu hi. Ama in ki ni nei hi. A ki tegel sau tuoh a, ahi vangin khat pen adang khat sangin sauzaw hi. Tua a sauzaw pen a po nukhia zaw ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua tuutang in a ki tawh nitumna lam, sahlam, le hlanglam a suh kawikawi ka mu hi. Gamsa zosie in ama nangzo loin ama’ thahatna panin koima in hunkhie zo lo hi; ama’ dei bangin gamta-in a thahat semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in ka et laitahin nitumna lam panin keeltang khat ang kilang a, lei tuon loin leitung buppi a kansan hi. Tua keel in a mit tegel kikalah ki khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ki ni a nei gun gei-a ding ka musa tuutang kung zuonin a thanei za tawh ama a tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua keeltang in tuutang lam a nai ka mu hi. A lungthah sengin tua tuutang a ki tawh su a, a ki ni a tawngsan hi. Tuutang in ama a nan zawh nading hatna nei lo hi; ama in tua tuutang tuolsena-in nei-in tuoncil a, ama’ hatna panin tuutang a hunkhie zo koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua keeltang nahpi tahin ang vanglien hi; ahi vangin a thahat pen laitahin a ki golpi tawngsan a, khum munah leimong li lam kinga-in a lamdang ki li a momkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuate lahah khat tungah a neu ki adang khat mom a, leitaw lam, nisuona lam, gam hoi lam nga-in nahpi tahin vanglien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vantung galkap honte bangin a thahatna khangto a, ama in vantung galkap honkhat le aasi honkhat leitungah khiesuhin a tuoncil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama kiliensahin van galkap lamkaipa nangawn a do hi; ama in a kibawl zing meihal biehna lahpiehin ama’ mun siengtho zong a lemangpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gitlona ziehin tuami ki tungah nisim meihal biehna le galkap honpite kipie a, tua ki in tualah thuman a paisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin a siengtho pa khat thugen ka za a, adang a siengthopa khat in tua thugenpa kungah, “Nisima meihal biehna, nate a hawmmangsah suhkhielna, le mun siengtho le vantung galkapte totcil dinga a kipieh nading tawh kisai tami mangmuna bang tanvei sawt ding ahei” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in dawng a, “Zingmawng le nitah tulni le zathum sawt ding hi; tua ciengin ama mun ngai ma ah mun siengtho kikoikia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima Daniel in mangmuna ka mu zaw ciengin tuami khietna ka thei nadingin ka hanciem hi. Tua ciengin mihing melpuo khat ka mai-ah ang ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuale Ulai panin mihing’ aw khat ka za a, “Gabriel aw, tam mipa mangmuna theisah in,” ci-in hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in ka dinna gei ang nai a, ang tun ciengin ka zau seng ziehin ka bawhsuh hi. Ahi vangin ama in keima kungah, “Mihing aw, mangmuna pen hun tawp cieng ading ahi lam thei in,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in keima ei hopi laitahin khuophawh nawn loin tuolah ka pua hi; tua bepin ama in kei ei thamin ka kengin ei dingsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in, “Ngai vawi, lungthah hun tawp cienga ang pieng ding thute ang gen ding ka hi hi; azieh pen tua khu a kisesa hun tawpna ding genna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ki ni a nei tuutang na mu pen Media le Persia kumpite a cina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keeltang pen Greek kumpipa hi a, a mit tegel kikala a po a ki gol pen khu kumpi masapen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ki a tawngsan, tua munah adang ki li a pote ahi uleh, ama’ gam sung panin kumpi gam li khang ding cina hi a, ahi vangin kumpi gam masa pen bangin hat zo lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amau’ uhna tawpin, khielnate ang bukim ciengin, zuouphuo siem le hansan mel a puo kumpi khat ang khang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama thahatin ang vanglien ding a, ama in a zauhuoi sietna piengsahin, a sepna-ah lawcing ding hi. Ama in mi thahatte le misiengte a susie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A khelpilna tawh a khut in zuou bawlin cithei ding a, a lungsim zong kiliensah ding hi. Hilkhol loin mi tampi thatin, kumpite’ Kumpipa nangawn langpan ding a, hizongle mihing khut tawh hi loin ama kisusie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zingmawng le nitaha mangmuna kigen pen a man ahi hi. Nang na hileh tua mangmuna imcip phot in, azieh pen tua khu tu-a kipanin ang tung ding hun sawtpi ading ahi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima Daniel, thazaw gawpin ni phabep khat sung ka ci a na hi; tua ciengin ka tho a, kumpipa nasep sem dingin ka kuon hi. Ahi vangin ka mangmuna in ei zauthawngsah a, tua khu ka theitel zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mede minam Ahasuerus’ tapa Darius in Chaldea-te gam sunga kumpi a suo masah kum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a kumpi sep a masa pen kumin keima Daniel in a kum phaza ding Lai Siengtho sungah Topa in kamsang Jeremiah kunga a na gen dung zui-in Jerusalem a kisuhsiet hun ang tung valon ding a, tua khu kum sawm sagi sung hi ding hi, ci-in ka cien thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka thungetna le ka thumna ei dawn nadingin keima in an ngawlin la-ip puon silin vut ka kibuoh a, Topa lam ka kinga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka Topa Pasien kungah thungenin mawna ka pulah a, “A lien le a giinhuoi Pasien, nang ang it mite le na thupieh a zui mite tungah thuciemna pel loin itna kip a nei Topa aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />kote maw-in khielna ka bawl vua, gitlo gamtatin kang ledo vade vua, na thupiehte le na ngaina kipte panin ka kihei zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kumpite uh, ka vaihawmte uh, ka pu ka pate ule gam sunga mi zosie kungah na min tawh thugen na nasem kamsangte’ thu ka ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Topa aw, nang lamah dihna om a, ahi vangin nangma tungah amate a thuman lo ziehun gam zosie-ah na nawmangsa Judah mite, Jerusalem-a tengte, a nai a gamla-a om Israel-te zosie ahi kote tungah tuni-a bangin maizumna ang tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa aw, nangma tunga kang khiel ziehun ka kumpite uh, ka vaihawmte uh, ka pu ka pate ule koma tungah maizumna ang tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa ka Pasien uh kungah hepina le mawmaisahna a om hi, azieh pen kote in ama ka ledo vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuale a nasem kamsangte tungtawnin ka mai vua a koi a thukhamte zui loin Topa ka Pasien uh thugen ka mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Israel zosie in na thukham palsatin a kilehei vua, na aw zong a ngai sih uhi. Tuaci’n nangma tungah ka maw zo tah ziehun Pasien’ nasem Moses thukham sunga a kigiel samsietna le awsiete kote tungah ang kibuosuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in kote langkhat le ka vaihawmte langkhatah a gensa thute kipsah a, kote tungah tuosietna lienpi tungsah zo a, tua Jerusalem-a a tunsah gimna bang pen vansin nei buppi-ah khatvei beh zong tung ngai nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses’ thukham sunga a kigiel bang lienin tam tuosietna teng zosie kote tungah ang tungzo ta hi. Kote in ka khielnate uh taisanin, ama’ thumanna ka lungngai thei nadingun Topa ka Pasien uh kungah hepina ka ngen sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in kote tunga a tunsah masangsie tam tuosietna a koicing hi. Topa i Pasien uh pen a sepna zosie-ah a dih tahtah ahi hi; bangzieh ahei cile kote in ama thu ka mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Khut thahat khat tawh Egypt panin na mite peipi-in tuni cieng dong nangawnin na min a thangsah kote’ Topa Pasien aw, tu-in kote ka maw vua, ka gitlo gamtat ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa aw, thudih tawh na gamtatna zosie ziehin na muol siengtho, na khuopi Jerusalem panin na lungthahna le na thangpaina heimang dawh ta’n; ka mawna ule ka pu ka pate uh’ khielna ziehin ka veng ka pam zosie lahah Jerusalem le na mite mi simmaw-in ka om ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa aw, na nasempa thungetna le thumna ei ngai inlen, tu-in nangma adinga kinuasiesa na mun siengtho tungah na mai hing tangsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka Topa Pasien aw, na bil ei ngat inlen ei za in. Na mit hahsah inlen kote le nangma’ min a puo khuopi sietna en in. Ka dihna uh zieh hi loin, na khuotuona lienpi ziehin na mai-ah thumna ang nei ka hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa aw, ei za in; Topa aw, ei maisah in; Topa aw, ei ngai-in ei bawlpieh inlen kiheh ta sin! Azieh pen na khuopi le na mite nangma’ min puo ahi uhi, ka Topa Pasien aw!” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima in ka mawna le ka mi Israel’ mawna ka pulah kawmin hamin thu ka nget laitah le ka Pasien’ muol siengtho tangin Topa ka Pasien mai-ah thumna ka nei laitah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />thu ka ngetnget laitah, nitah biehpiehna hun pawlin ka mangmu masah lai-a ka musa Gabriel kici mipa ka kungah mallang tahin ang leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama ang pei a, keima kungah, “Daniel, tu-in pilna le theitelna pie dinga ang pei ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thumna na nei pat tahin thu khat ang pusuoh a, tua thu gen dinga ang pei ka hi hi, azieh pen nahpitahin nang ang ki-it hi. Tuaci’n khum thu ngaisun inlen mangmuna theitel in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Na mite le khuopi siengtho in khielna a tawpsan nading, mawna suhmang nading, le khielna zieha mawsut nading, kumtawn dihna a tun nading, kamsanna le mangmuna khahcip nading, le siengtho pen mun sathau nu nadingin nipikal sawmsagi sung kise zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin thei inlen telcien in: Jerusalem a kilamkia nading thu a kipieh huna kipanin sathau kinu pa hun dong nipikal sagi sung hi ding hi; tuale nipikal sawmguh le ni sungin gawlzin lampite le tuikulte kibawlkia ding a, ahi vangin lungkham hun sung hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nipikal sawmguh le ni a tawp zaw ciengin sathau kinu mipa khat kisumaimang ding a, bangma a nei sih ding hi. Tuale ang pei ding ulienpa’ galkapte in tua khuopi le mun siengtho a susie ding uhi. Ama’ manthaina pen tuizin tun bang hi ding a, a tawp dongin gal kidona om ding hi. Suhsiet dinga thukip kibawlsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in mi tampite tawh nipikal khat sung thuciem khau khat bawl ding a, ama in tua nipikal alang sungin biehpiehna le biehnate khawlsah ding hi; tuale a susie pa tungah a tawpna thukip a kibuohsuh dongin tuate munah a susie kidahhuoi na khat kikoi ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Persia kumpipa Cyrus kumpi a suo zaw a kum thumna kumin Belshazzar kici Daniel kungah thu khat kihil hi. Tua thu thuman hi a, kidona lienpi khat tawh kisai ahi hi. Ama in tua thu thei a, mangmuna sunga a mu zong theitel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum hunin keima Daniel, nipikal thum sung ka kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nipikal thum vilvel an le tui bangma ne loin ka kam in zu le sa a ciem sih a, sathau zong ka kinu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hla masa ni sawmni le li ni-in gun golpi gei-ah (tua pen Tigris gun ahi hi) ka din laitahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ka dahto leh saihadiel puon silin, a kawng kimvela Uphaz gam pieng kham kawnggah a gah mi khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tahsa pen beryl suongmanpha bangin vam lihleh a, a maitang tunphe bangin tangin, a mittangte meikuong tawh kibang a, a bante le a kengte sumngo nawtngilsa bangin tee lihlehin, a awging pen mihonpi aa-ul husa tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima Daniel beh in tua mangmuna ka mu hi; keima tawh a omtonte nahpi tahin a zau vangun tua mangmuna a mu sih vua, tuale amate taimangin a kiphuol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n a thupi tami mangmuna mu dingin keima tangin ei kinuasie hi. Ka tha ka zung teng tawpin ka ci ka sa kangdang a, tha le zung kici ka nei ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin a awging ka za hi; tuale khuophawh nawn loin tuolah ka puasuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin khut khat in ei thamin ka khut le ka khupin ei phongto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, “Daniel, nang ang ki-it mama hi, nang kunga kang gen ding thute thudon in. Nang kungah kei ei kisawlzo ahi ziehin dingtang in,” ei ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in kei kungah tam thu ang gen laitahin a citun pumin ka dingto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, “Daniel aw, zau sin, azieh pen theitel nopna lungsim le nang le nang Pasien mai-ah kiniemkhieh nopna lungsim nei na sawm masah pen ni-a kipanin na thugente a kiza zo ta a, tua na thugente zieha ang pei ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Persia kumpi gam uhpa in ni sawmni le ni khat sung keima ei nang hi. Tuaci’n keima ei panpi dingin gam uhpite lahah khat ahi Michael ang kuonin ei panpi a, Persia kumpi gam uhpa tawh tua munah ama ka nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hun nukhia ni ciengin na mite tungah bang thu ang pieng ding ahei ci na theitel nadingin ang panpi dinga ang pei ka hi hi. Bangzieh ahei cile tami pen ang tung lai nite adinga mangmuna ahi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in tam thu teng a gen laitahin ka mai tuolkunin ka ham thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin mihing melpuo khat in ka nephu ei thampieh a, thu gen dingin ka kam kahin ka mai-a ding pa kungah, “Ka pu aw, ka mangmu ziehin ka tungah tam bang natnate ang tungzo ahi ziehin tha zong ka nei ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka pu nasempa in ka pu tawh bang i ci kiho thei diei? Azieh pen citun dildelin tha ka nei ta sih a, naahu zong ka nei ta sih hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing melpuo khat in keima ei thamkia leuleu a, ei thakhausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in, “Ang ki-it mama pa aw, zau sin, nang adingin lungmuon a om hi. Na tha khausah inlen hangsan in!” ei ci hi. Ama in kei ei hopi ciengin ka tha ang hat pai a, “Ka pu aw thu gen in, azieh pen nang in kei nei thakhausah ta hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Nang kungah bang dinga hing pei ka hei ci na thei ei mah? Tu-in Persia gam uhpa sim dingin ka kilekia lo phamaw a, ama ka zaw ciengin Greek uhpa ang pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin thuman laibu sungah bang kigiel ci kang gen ding hi. Na gam uhpa uh Michael ci simlo tam gam uhte ei dopi thei ding ka kungah koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei ka hile Mede mi Darius a kum khatna kumin ama panpi dingin ka ding a, ama ka thakhausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tu-in nangma kungah thuman kang tangko ding hi. Persia gamah kumpi thum khang lai ding hi. A lina pen tuate zosie sangin hauzaw ding a, a hauna huvangin a thahat ciengin ama in Greek kumpi gam langpang dingin mi zosie a holtuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin galhang kumpi khat khang ding a, ama in thuneina aana tawh uhin a nop bangbangin gamta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama a vangliet laitahin a kumpi gam kehin leimong li lam manaw-in kikhenkhe ding a, ahi vangin ama’ suonlehlahte in vai a hawm nawn sih ding a, aana tawh a vaihawm lai a bang nawn sih ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile a kumpi gam kiphungkal ding a, tam mite simlo midangte kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tua ciengin leitaw lam kumpipa thahat ding a, ahi vangin a uliente lahah khat pen ama sangin thahatzaw-in ama’ gam sanga a golzaw gam khat a uh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kum phabep khat zaw ciengin amate in kipawltonna a bawl ding vua, leilu lam kumpipa kungah thukimna bawl dingin leitaw lam kumpipa’ tanu a pei ding hi. Ahi vangin tua nu in a aana a tusuoh zo sih ding a, a suonlehlahte zong a kip sih ding hi. A cingte, a tapa le a panpite tawh tua nu kithat ding hi. “Khum hun sung tengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua pa munah tua nu’ gui panin a ba khat a khang ding hi. Galkapte sim dingin ama kuon ding a, leilu lam kumpipa’ kulpi-ah lutin amate simin a zo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in a pasien-te uh nangawn, a milimte uh, ngun le kham tawh a kibawl a vanzah manpha teng utawh, Egypt gamah puomang ding a, ama in bakhat sung leilu lam kumpipa a do ding a ki-ip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin leilu lam kumpipa in leitaw lam kumpipa’ gam sim ding a, ahi vangin ama’ gamah a kilekia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“A tate in gal a bawl ding vua, galkap tampitah kaikhawmin tuikhang bangin kuonin a kansan ding vua, a kulpi dongah gal kidona a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leitaw lam kumpipa a lungthahsa-in kuonin leilu lam kumpipa a sim ding hi. Leilu lam kumpipa in galkap tampi a khop vangin leitaw lam kumpipa’ galkapte in a zo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Galkap honpite a kipeipi ciengin a lungsim kiliensahin tulsawm tulza simin thatgam ding a, ahi vangin a zo tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile leilu lam kumpipa in a masa sanga a tamzaw galkap honpi khonkia-in kum phabep khat zaw ciengin neh le tah kicingin galkap tampi tawh a kuonsuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Khum hun ciengin mi tampi in leitaw lam kumpipa a sim ding uhi. Na mite lahah a mottat mite in tua mangmuna a tangtun nadingin a sim ding vua, ahi vangin amate in gal a lel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin leilu lam kumpipa kuonin khuopi imtawmna lei sungvum ding a, kul tawh ki-im khuopi a la ding hi. Leitaw lam galkapte in a nang zo sih ding vua, a teeltuom a galkapte nangawn in zong a nang zo sih ding uhi, azieh pen amate in nan zawh nading tha a nei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama sim dinga a kuon pa in a dei bangin bawl ding a, koima in ama nang zo lo ding hi. Ama in gam nuom-ah panmun la ding a, tua gam teng zosie ama’ thuneina sungah om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kumpi gambup’ tha tawh ama kuon ding a, kilem nading thute puo-in tuate sep sawm ding hi. Tua kumpi gam a suhsiet thei nadingin numei khat tawh ama kinungsah ding hi; ahi vangin a gelna muolsuo zo loin a phattuompi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin ama tuipi pang gam tengah kihei-in gam tampitah a zo ding hi. Ahi vangin galkapmang khat in a mi thusimlona teng maimangsah ding hi; a tahtahin mi thusim lona teng ama tungah a tusahkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama a gam sunga kulpite lam manaw-in kilekia ding a, ahi vangin ama kipalpua-in a kimu zo nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tua ciengin ama’ munah mi khat khangin tua pa in a kumpi gam thupi nadingin ulien khat a sawl ding hi; ahi vangin ni tomkal sungin lungthahna le gal kidona zieh hi loin ama kisugam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama’ munah kumpi thupina a kipie lo, a simmawhuoi mipa khat khang ding hi; genkhol loin ama kuonin zuouthu tawh kumpi gam a tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama mai-ah galkapte kisumaimang ding a, thuciemna bawl ulienpa zong kisugam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuale ama tawh kipawltonna a bawl zaw ciengin ama zuoutatin mi themno khat tawh a thahat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Genkhol loin gam sunga leihoi pen munah pei-in a pu a pate in a na bawl ngai nai lo silte bawl ding a, galvanlahte, van kitomgamte, le haunate vautahin amate a hawmpieh ding hi. Ama in mun muonhuoite sim sawm ding a, ahi vangin bakhat sung beh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in leitaw lam kumpipa sim dingin galkap tampi tawh a hatna le a khensatna satsuo ding a, leitaw lam kumpipa in a tamzaw le a hatzaw galkap tawh na do ding hi. Hinanle ama in a zo sih ding hi, azieh pen kumpi’ an a ne mite in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ama do ding a sawmdap ding uhi. Amate in ama sugamin ama’ galkapte zong kisumaimang ding a, mi tampitah a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpi tegel in a lungsim vuah gitlo ding beh a sawm vua, sabuoi khatah to tonin zuouthu a gen tuoh ding uhi. Ahi vangin a lawcing sih ding hi, azieh pen a kisesa tawpna ding hun tung lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama’ gamah nei le lam tampi tawh kilekia ding a, ahi vangin ama in a lungsimin a siengtho thuciemna langpan ding hi. A nop a thei-in ama gamta-in a gamah kilekia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“A kisesa hun a cin ciengin ama kilekia-in leitaw lamah kuonsuh ding a, hizongle tam hun pen a masalaite tawh kibang lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Azieh pen ama sim dingin Kittim tembawte pei ding a, tuale ama lungkie-in a kilekia ding hi. Ama kithangpaisah ding a, tuaci’n thuciemna siengtho a lang bawl ding hi. Ama kilekia-in tua thuciemna siengtho a taisante a thupi bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama’ sawl galkapte in biehinnpi le kulpi la-in a buasah ding uhi. Amate in nisim meihal biehna a khawlsah ding vua, a susie ding sil kidahuoi a koi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in zuouthu tawh thuciemna palsatte a zawl ding hi; hinanle a pasien uh tunga thuman mite in dingkipin a do ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mite lahah mipilte in mi tampi tungah theitelna a neisah ding uhi; ahi vangin ni tomkal sungin meikuong le namsau tawh amate a si ding vua, sal dingin kipeipi-in kitomgam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate in tua banga a thuoh uh ciengin panpina themkhat beh a nga sam ding vua, mi tampite in lungsim tahtah hi lopi-in amate a pawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tawpna hun a tun masangin amate kisusiengin kisiensuo a, a kisawpsieng thei nadingin mipil kim khat kithat ding hi, azieh pen a kisesa hun a tun masangin a kikalah hun khat a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Tua kumpipa a nop bangbangin a gamta ding hi. Ama le ama kitawisangin ama le ama pasien khat popo sangin a lienzaw-in kingaisun ding a, tuaci’n pasien-te’ Pasien langkhatah cizat huoi kam a ham ding hi. Lungthahna hun a bukim masangsie ama a cithei ding hi, azieh pen a kisesa bangin kisem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in a pu a pate’ pasien-te ahi sihle numeite’ deite zatah lo ding hi; ama in pasien dang khat popo zong a zatah sih ding hi, azieh pen tuate zosie sangin ama le ama a lienzaw-in a kingaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama in tam teng tangin kulpi cing pasien-te zatahzaw ding a, ngun le kham, suong manphate le letsong mantamte tawh a pu a pate’ na theikhah lo pasien a patawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama in gamdang pasien khat’ panpina tawh kulpidet pente a sim ding hi. Ama in ama a pom mite hausah semsemin mi tampite tungah vaihawmin koi ding a, a man tawh kizui-in leitangte a hawmpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Hun tawp ni ciengin leitaw lam kumpipa in ama a sim ding hi. Ahi vangin leilu lam kumpipa in sakol leengte, sakol galkapte, le tembaw tampi tawh pumpei bangin a simgawp ding hi. Gamcin teng do dingin ama kuon ding a, tuikhang bangin a nawtsuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Gamnuom sungah ama lutin mi tul tampi tahin sina thuoh ding a, ahi vangin ama’ khut sung panin Edom, Moab, le Ammon gam thupi mun teng suohta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ama in a khut zahin tua gamte sim ding a, Egypt gam a suohta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Kham le ngun ahi goute le Egypt hauna zosie tungah ama vaihawmin pang ding hi; tuale Libya le Ethiopia mite in ama nua a zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ahi vangin nisuona lam le leilu lam pana thu kipuohte in ama patausah ding a, mi tampitah a susie ding le a sumaimang dingin thangpaina tawh ama a kuon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ama in a etlawm muol siengtho le tuipi kikalah a kumpi puonbuhte a sung ding hi. Hinanle koima’ panpi loin ama si ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Khum hunin na mite a cing ulienpipa Michael ang khang ding hi. Minamte piencil a kipanin a pieng ngai nai lo lungkhamna hun ang tung ding hi. Hizongnanle khum hun ciengin laibu sunga a kigiel a min kimukhie zosie kihunkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitung leivui lahah a kimu mi tampite tho ding a, pawl khatte kumtawn hinna, pawl khatte maizumna le kumtawn simmawna nga dingin a tho ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pilte ahi uleh vantung khuovah bangin a tang ding vua, dihna lamah mi tampi a puite pen aasi bangin a tang tawntung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hizongle Daniel aw, tawpna hun a tun masangin tam thute genzah sinlen laibu khahcip phot in. Mi tampi a suhtai a totai ding vua, sietna a khang ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima Daniel in ka en leh, adang mi ni ang kilang a, khat pen tami lui pang lamah, a khat pen khumi lui pang lamah a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate lahah saihadiel puon a sil luinah lama a ding mipa in, “Tam sil lamdangte a tawp nading bang tanvei sawt ding ahei?” ci-in dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Luinah lama a ding saihadiel puon a sil tua mipa in a khut zietlam le veilam vantung lamah a lamto hi. Tuale khum hun pen hun khat, hun ni, le hun lang hi ding a, mi siengthote’ vanglietna a kisiet hun ciengin tam sil zosie kimuolsuo ding hi,” ci-in a hing zing pa’ minin a kiciem ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka zah vangin ka telcien sih hi; tuaci’n keima in, “Ka pu aw, tam teng pi bang hingci pien ding ahei?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, “Daniel aw, pei ta’n, azieh pen tawpna hun a tun masangin tua thute selcip imcip ahi ding hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tampi kisiensuo kinawt zolin kinawt ngo ding hi, hinanle migilote ahile a gitlo gamtat uh a zomsuoh ding uhi. Migilote khat beh in a theisiem sih ding vua, ahi vangin mipilte in a theisiem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nisima kibawl meihal biehna kikhawlsahin a susie sil kidahhuoi a kikoi huna kipanin ni tulkhat zani le sawmkuo sung sawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni tulkhat zathum sawmthum le nga sung a thuoh zo kenkonte in thupha a nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin nang na hi leh na lampi ah pei inlen tawlnga in; hun tawp ni ciengin na thaman sang dingin na tho ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
</usx>
